sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PER001 as PER-001 (Personal Customer)
    participant CH001 as CH-001 (Online Banking Portal)
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API (SVC-001)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (SVC-102)
    participant CAP003 as CAP-003 API (SVC-009)
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005 (SVC-014/SVC-051)
    participant EXTCOP as EXT: Pay.UK CoP Service
    participant EXTRTGS as EXT: Bank of England RTGS (RT2)
    participant SVC002 as SVC-002 (Mortgage Service)
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 (Notifications)

    Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-077: Payment Initiation
    PER001->>CH001: Enter beneficiary details, amount (£450k), purpose=PROP
    CH001->>CAP001: POST /chaps-payments (ENT-053 creation)
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish CHAPSPaymentIntentCreated EVT-108
    CAP001-->>CH001: 201 chaps_intent_id + status=initiated + cutoff_time

    Note over CAP003,EXTCOP: PH-078: Confirmation of Payee Check
    EventBus--)CAP003: EVT-108 consumed — trigger CoP check
    CAP003->>EXTCOP: CoP request (sort_code, account_number, beneficiary_name)
    EXTCOP-->>CAP003: result=match
    CAP003--)EventBus: publish CHAPSCoPCheckCompleted EVT-109 (result=match)

    Note over CAP005: PH-079: Sanctions Screening
    EventBus--)CAP005: EVT-108 consumed — sanctions screening initiated
    CAP005->>CAP005: SVC-014 → SVC-051 screen beneficiary (<3000ms GOV-005-R02)
    CAP005--)EventBus: publish SanctionsScreeningCompleted EVT-180 (result=clear)
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-109 + EVT-180 consumed — status→sanctions_complete

    Note over PER001,CAP001: PH-080: Payment Authorisation
    CH001->>CAP001: GET /chaps-payments/{id} — poll status=sanctions_complete
    CAP001-->>CH001: 200 status=sanctions_complete + cop_result=match + payment_summary
    CH001->>PER001: Display summary + irrevocability warning + SCA challenge
    PER001->>CH001: Complete SCA (biometric approval)
    CH001->>CAP001: POST /chaps-payments/{id}/authorise (sca_credential)
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish CHAPSPaymentAuthorised EVT-110 (funds reserved)
    CAP001-->>CH001: 200 status=authorised + estimated_settlement

    Note over CAP003,EXTRTGS: PH-081: CHAPS Submission and Settlement
    EventBus--)CAP003: EVT-110 consumed — create CHAPSPaymentExecution ENT-052
    CAP003->>CAP003: Generate UETR, construct ISO 20022 pacs.008 (purpose=PROP)
    CAP003->>EXTRTGS: Submit pacs.008 to RTGS (RT2)
    EXTRTGS-->>CAP003: RTGS acceptance + settlement confirmation
    CAP003--)EventBus: publish CHAPSPaymentSettled EVT-111 (settled_at, uetr)
    CAP003--)EventBus: publish MortgageCompletionPaymentConfirmed EVT-112 [if mortgage]

    Note over CAP001,PER001: PH-082: Completion Confirmation
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-111 consumed — debit Account ENT-004, update chaps_daily_total
    EventBus--)SVC002: EVT-112 consumed — MortgageAccount status→completed
    CAP001--)SVC053: Dispatch settlement notification (push + email)
    SVC053--)PER001: Push notification: CHAPS payment of £450k settled
